# Data Analytics & Visual Report

## Dataset Focus
Davao Region Agricultural Production Index (CSV Analysis)

### 1. Data Cleaning Protocol Log

**Raw Input Problems**
- Missing values in production data
- Duplicate municipality records
- Mixed units (kg and Metric Tons)
- Extra spaces in province names

**AI Cleaning Actions**
- Removed duplicate records
- Filled missing values using median production per crop
- Converted all production values to Metric Tons (MT)
- Standardized municipality and province names
- Converted numeric columns to proper data types

**Result**
- Processed 150 records
- Corrected 12 missing values
- Removed 8 duplicate entries

